{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有。Y在S07、S11压缩了人物当初离开的考虑、后来对孤独的反思，以及选择先过好眼下生活的理由，因果交代不如X充分。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"平\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的重点句更短，【】加亮让人扫屏时容易抓住人物每一阶段的心理变化，感受又按音乐节点出现，不必一次消化所有文字。它的感受描写也更细腻具体，能从旋律、节奏、音色一直落到呼吸、脚步和身体反应，而不是停留在情绪标签上。X的优势是人物心理因果交代更完整，尤其S07和S11，因此Y虽然整体更适合边听边看，但在理解人物为什么这样选择方面有所损失。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "412f6116-a440-4bdd-aa24-891f9f1ee649", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T212357076155Z", "elapsed_seconds": 56.297, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T21:24:53.384067+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "3947ec549461599fda178bf4a568cda87b9cf54129b0f66357d678cb87bd48d5", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_at